The four-seed LOWO width-8 mean is now fixed at about `R² = −0.1605`, ordering `0.7073`, top-1 `0.3160`. LOWO level transfer remains negative for that sealed head, while ranking and argmax improve sharply; the prescribed reading is already determined by the material LOAO movements.
